The DSP in this folder (src/, op1/) is a fixed-point implementation after Mutable Instruments' Rings and Plaits
ensemble (fx/ensemble.h) and Clouds' half-rate output stage (https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack, with stmlib),
made in coldsoldr/te-op1-cfw (ports/fx/src/ensemble, ports/clouds/src/core/halfband, ports/fx/op1/half_rate.h) and
released under the same terms as the originals. ensemble.cc and gen_tables.py are coop's own (GPL-3.0-or-later with
the OP-1 firmware permission, see ../../LICENSE and ../../NOTICE); the plugin file built from them is conveyed under
the GPL, which the MIT terms allow.

